---
import { LICENSE, PROJECT, VERSAO } from "../consts";
---

<header class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-neutral-900">
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-60"
    style="background: radial-gradient(60rem 30rem at 50% -10%, rgba(45,184,158,0.12), transparent 70%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-32">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald/30 bg-emerald/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-emerald">
        Projeto IA.med
      </span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-ink-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400">
        Licença {LICENSE}
      </span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-ink-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400">
        Experimento de pesquisa
      </span>
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 bg-ink-800 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-neutral-400">
        v{VERSAO}, repositório privado
      </span>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-amber-300">
      <svg class="h-4 w-4 flex-shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v4m0 4h.01M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 001.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 001.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 00-3.42 0z" />
      </svg>
      Não revisado clinicamente
    </p>

    <h1 class="mt-6 font-mono text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-6xl">
      {PROJECT}
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-neutral-300 sm:text-xl">
      Raciocínio clínico em contexto brasileiro num LLM local: o que ele acerta,
      o que ele erra, e a avaliação publicada aqui. O código está num repositório
      privado nesta versão.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        href="#resultados"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink-900 transition-colors hover:bg-emerald-400"
      >
        Ver a avaliação
        <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 8.25l-7.5 7.5-7.5-7.5" />
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a
        href="#onde-falha"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 transition-colors hover:border-emerald hover:text-emerald"
      >
        Onde ele falha
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
